ge group, and turns ordinary wedding moments into exciting, shared experiences. This comprehensive guide covers everything you need to plan the perfect wedding bingo game."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why Wedding Bingo Works"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Unlike other wedding games that can feel forced or awkward, bingo is universally understood and requires zero setup from guests. Cards are placed at each table setting, and guests simply mark squares as moments happen naturally throughout the reception. There's no interruption to the flow of the event — bingo runs in the background while everything else happens organically."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"50+ Wedding Bingo Square Ideas"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The key to great wedding bingo is a mix of moments that are guaranteed to happen, ones that are likely, and a few wildcards. Here's our curated list:"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Guaranteed Moments (Easy Squares)"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"First kiss as a married couple"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Bride and groom's first dance"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Cake cutting ceremony"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Best man speech"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Maid of honor speech"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Bouquet toss"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"DJ plays a slow song"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Champagne toast"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Father-daughter dance"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Mother-son dance"}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Likely Moments (Medium Squares)"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Someone cries during a speech"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Guest takes a selfie with the couple"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"A child runs across the dance floor"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Someone clinks their glass for a kiss"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Dad tells a joke in his speech"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Bride changes shoes"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Someone r